id: fused-transformation
name: Fused Transformation
# A Fusion Modifier: chosen as a Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs), never picked by hand. Its Prerequisite is shown there, never enforced.
fusionModifier: true
# (4) The Fused Form's Attribute Modifier Bonus (AG/FO/TE/MA) by its Form Type (transformations.mjs bonusesOf, fusedFormIds).
fusedFormBonus: alternate 1; legendary 2
description: >
  Your disparate experiences with the transformations at your command allow you to empower those transformations shared by your Fused Characters.
text: >
  Fused Transformation: Your disparate experiences with the transformations at your command allow you to empower those transformations shared by your Fused Characters.
  (1)-[Prerequisite, Ruling]: All of the Fused Characters have access to the same Form. Any Forms that are possessed by all Fused Characters are known as the ‘Fused Form’.
  (2)-[Passive]: If your Fused Form is in a Transformation Line with higher Stages, you gain access to those higher Stages if your base Tier of Power meets their Tier of Power Requirement.
  (3)-[Passive]: Ignore the reduction to your Stress Bonus from Health Threshold Penalties when attempting to enter a Fused Form or while in a Fused Form (but no other Transformation).
  (4)-[Passive]: Increase the Attribute Modifier Bonus (AG/FO/TE/MA) of your Fused Form by an amount depending on the type of Form for that Transformation:

  Alternate Form: 1(T)
  Legendary Form: 2(T)

---

# (1) Its Prerequisite: shown as the Fusion is fused (fusion-make.mjs modifierChecks) - the Fused Forms named.
# (2) The higher Stages of a Fused Form's Line, by base Tier of Power: added from the Transformations tab - the table's.
# (3) The Health Threshold Penalties to the Stress Bonus ignored for a Fused Form: the table's.
# (4) Its header.
